* Opcode definitions

* AND   000
* OR    001
* ADD   010

* LOAD  100
* STORE 101
* SUB   110
* NOT   111


* State transitions


* case (current_state)


* S0:   next_state = S1;


* S1:   if (OP == LOAD) next_state = S2;    else if (OP == STORE) next_state = S4;  else next_state = S5;

* S2:   next_state = S3;

* S3:   next_state = S0;

* S4:   next_state = S0;

* S5:   next_state = S6;

* S6:   next_state = S0;

* endcase


